ission, dan financial."}],problems:["Vendor sulit dikelola, kontrak dan komisi berantakan.","Komisi agen sulit direkap, error dan tidak transparan.","Laporan internal tidak terstruktur, sulit mengambil keputusan.","Multi-cabang tidak terintegrasi, data terpisah-pisah.","Financial accounting internal masih manual di Excel.","Approval workflow tidak jelas, bottlenecks di mana-mana.","Marketplace internal tidak ada, vendor dan agen sulit berkolaborasi."],results:["Vendor dan agen dikelola dalam portal terpisah yang rapi.","Commission engine otomatis menghitung komisi agen dan vendor.","Financial accounting internal: kas masuk, keluar, utang, piutang.","Laporan profit per paket dan per perjalanan, transparan dan akurat.","Multi-cabang terintegrasi dengan approval workflow yang jelas.","Marketplace internal untuk katalog dari multiple vendor.","Management dashboard untuk pengambilan keputusan berbasis data."],tiers:[{name:"Management Starter",price:"Mulai Rp24.900.000",target:"Travel multi-divisi",pages:"Website + Dashboard Manajemen",features:["Semua fitur Productivity Platform","CRM & lead management","Database pelanggan & peserta","Vendor management","Agen & reseller management","Commission engine","Financial accounting internal","Pemasukan & pengeluaran","Profit per paket/perjalanan","Multi-user & role","Approval workflow","Management dashboard"],packages:"Tidak dibatasi wajar",users:"Menyesuaikan kebutuhan",revisions:"Berdasarkan scope",estimate:"1–3 bulan",support:"90–180 hari",domain:"Cloud hosting sesuai kebutuhan",annual:"Mulai Rp 2.000.000/tahun"},{name:"Management Enterprise",price:"Custom Quote",target:"Travel enterprise / multi-cabang",pages:"Full Platform + Multi-Cabang",features:["Semua fitur Management Starter","Multi-cabang / multi-brand","Marketplace katalog internal","Multi-vendor internal","Lead distribution","Portal corporate client","Laporan operasional & management","Custom workflow","AI assistant advanced","Dedicated infrastructure"],packages:"Tid