-placeholder.jpg"]},{slug:"al-madinah-travel",name:"Al-Madinah Travel",segment:"Umrah & Haji",year:"2024",timeline:"16 Hari Kerja",package:"Smart Travel Catalog",color:"#FF6B00",status:"Live",liveUrl:"https://almadinahtravel.example.com",cover:"/images/portofolio/al-madinah-travel.jpg",summary:"Travel umrah & haji yang melayani ribuan jamaah per tahun. Sulit menjelaskan detail paket umrah dan jadwal keberangkatan secara transparan.",challenge:"Detail paket umrah (itinerary, hotel, maskapai, include/exclude) tersebar di WhatsApp. Jamaah bingung membedakan paket reguler, plus, dan eksekutif. Tidak ada transparansi jadwal keberangkatan.",solution:"Smart Travel Catalog dengan katalog paket umrah berdasarkan jenis (reguler, plus, eksekutif) dan bulan keberangkatan. Itinerary timeline lengkap, hotel & maskapai, download brosur, dan inquiry per paket.",result:"Jamaah lebih percaya karena informasi transparan. Pendaftaran meningkat 150%. Customer service menerima inquiry yang spesifik per paket, mengurangi kebingungan.",metrics:[{label:"Peningkatan Pendaftaran",value:"150%"},{label:"Paket Umrah Aktif",value:"35+"},{label:"Inquiry / Bulan",value:"280+"},{label:"Download Brosur",value:"600+/bln"}],features:["Katalog 35+ paket umrah","Filter jenis (reguler/plus/eksekutif)","Filter bulan keberangkatan","Itinerary timeline lengkap","Info hotel & maskapai","Include & exclude rinci","Download brosur PDF","Share paket ke WhatsApp","Multi-CS WhatsApp","Google Maps lokasi hotel","Promo popup & countdown","SEO dasar & blog artikel"],techStack:["React","Node.js","Tailwind CSS","Google Analytics","Google Search Console"],gallery:["/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg"]},{slug:"adventure-indonesia",name:"Adventure Indonesia",segment:"Open Trip",year:"2023",timeline:"4 Hari Kerja",package:"Travel Landing Page",color:"#10B981",status:"Live",liveUrl:"https://adventureindonesia.example.com",cover:"/images/portofolio/adventure-indonesia.jpg",summary:"Operator open trip yang sebelumnya hanya mengandalkan Instagram untuk promosi. Tidak memiliki website profesional.",challenge:"Hanya mengandalkan Instagram untuk promosi. Tidak ada website yang bisa di-share calon pelanggan. Informasi jadwal, harga, dan kuota open trip tersebar di DM Instagram.",solution:"Landing Page profesional dengan galeri foto, itinerary ringkas, info harga & kuota, form inquiry, dan sticky WhatsApp button. Desain adventure yang sesuai dengan brand.",result:"Mendapat 50+ inquiry per bulan melalui website. Brand terlihat lebih profesional. Bisa menjalankan iklan dengan landing page yang fokus dan conversion-oriented.",metrics:[{label:"Inquiry / Bulan",value:"50+"},{label:"Open Trip Aktif",value:"12+"},{label:"Conversion Rate",value:"3.2%"},{label:"Instagram Follower",value:"15K+"}],features:["1 halaman landing page","Desain adventure profesional","Info paket & harga","Itinerary ringkas","Galeri 10 foto","Form inquiry","WhatsApp button & sticky CTA","Google Maps","Basic SEO","Paket unggulan & promo","Include/exclude & syarat","Share ke WhatsApp"],techStack:["React","Tailwind CSS","Google Maps API","Basic SEO"],gallery:["/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg"]},{slug:"corporate-travel-solutions",name:"Corporate Travel Solutions",segment:"Corporate Travel",year:"2024",timeline:"35 Hari Kerja",package:"Travel Productivity Platform",color:"#8B5CF6",status:"Live",liveUrl:"https://corporatetravel.example.com",cover:"/images/portofolio/corporate-travel-solutions.jpg",summary:"Corporate travel management yang menangani perjalanan bisnis untuk perusahaan besar. Proses quotation dan manifest masih manual di Excel.",challenge:"Proses quotation, manifest, rooming list, dan voucher masih dibuat manual di Excel. Error sering terjadi. Data peserta tercecer di banyak file. Tim operasional tidak efisien.",solution:"Productivity Platform dengan manifest generator, rooming list generator, quotation & proposal generator, voucher perjalanan, run sheet, checklist keberangkatan, dan database peserta terpusat.",result:"Efisiensi operasional meningkat 70%. Error berkurang drastis. Dokumen perjalanan dibuat dalam hitungan menit. Semua data peserta terpusat dalam satu platform.",metrics:[{label:"Efisiensi Operasional",value:"70%"},{label:"Pengurangan Error",value:"85%"},{label:"Dokumen / Bulan",value:"200+"},{label:"Tim Operasional",value:"8 User"}],features:["Website + dashboard tools","Manifest generator","Rooming list generator","Quotation & proposal generator","Voucher perjalanan","Run sheet & timeline","Checklist keberangkatan","Database peserta terpusat","AI itinerary assistant","Operational dashboard","Export PDF & Excel","Maks 10 user dengan role"],techStack:["React","Node.js","Tailwind CSS","Cloud Hosting","AI API","PDF Generator"],gallery:["/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg"]},{slug:"bali-paradise-dmc",name:"Bali Paradise DMC",segment:"Destination Management",year:"2024",timeline:"18 Hari Kerja",package:"Smart Travel Catalog",color:"#0EA5E9",status:"Live",liveUrl:"https://baliparadise.example.com",cover:"/images/portofolio/bali-paradise-dmc.jpg",summary:"Destination Management Company (DMC) di Bali yang melayani klien internasional. Tidak bisa menampilkan banyak produk dan aktivitas secara efektif.",challenge:"Tidak bisa menampilkan ratusan aktivitas wisata, paket tour, dan layanan DMC secara efektif. Klien i