r rute & tarif, jadwal keberangkatan, legalitas perusahaan, testimoni, dan Google Review widget.",result:"Brand image meningkat signifikan. Booking via website naik 120%. Calon pelanggan bisa melihat armada dan rute dengan jelas sebelum menghubungi customer service.",metrics:[{label:"Booking via Website",value:"120%"},{label:"Armada Aktif",value:"25+"},{label:"Rute Tersedia",value:"40+"},{label:"Google Review",value:"4.8/5"}],features:["Hingga 5 halaman","Profil perusahaan lengkap","Legalitas & asosiasi","Galeri armada kendaraan","Daftar rute & tarif","Jadwal keberangkatan","Google Review widget","Testimoni pelanggan","Logo klien & partner","Form inquiry","WhatsApp CS","Google Maps & SEO dasar"],techStack:["React","Tailwind CSS","Google Maps API","Google Review API","Basic SEO"],gallery:["/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg","/images/template-travel/mobile-placeholder.jpg"]},{slug:"konsorsium-travel-id",name:"Konsorsium Travel ID",segment:"Konsorsium",year:"2024",timeline:"3 Bulan",package:"Travel Management Platform",color:"#F43F5E",status:"Live",liveUrl:"https://konsorsiumtravel.example.com",cover:"/images/portofolio/konsorsium-travel-id.jpg",summary:"Konsorsium travel yang menggabungkan multiple operator dalam satu platform. Vendor dan komisi sulit dikelola.",challenge:"Multiple operator tidak terintegrasi. Vendor sulit dikelola, kontrak dan komisi berantakan. Komisi agen sulit direkap. Multi-cabang tidak terintegrasi, data terpisah-pisah.",solution:"Management Platform dengan vendor portal, agen & reseller management, commission engine, financial accounting internal, marketplace internal, multi-cabang dengan approval workflow, dan management dashboard.",result:"Vendor dan agen dikelola dalam portal terpisah yang rapi. Commission engine otomatis menghitung komisi. Financial accounting internal transparan. Multi-cabang terintegrasi dengan approval workflow.